A="Wide high-angle documentary night photograph taken from an upper-floor window of a Polish housing estate. Grey communist-era prefabricated concrete apartment blocks, ten storeys, many windows lit warm yellow, some flickering blue TV light. Orange sodium streetlights along a wet asphalt street, a few parked ordinary European cars, bare November trees, light drizzle haze, overcast sky glowing orange from light pollution. Shot on Sony FX3 at high ISO, 35mm lens, natural fine grain, slightly muted colours, realistic, no people, no text, no logos."
B="Night photograph from inside a dark apartment looking out through a window. Foreground: dark silhouette of a window frame, a radiator below the sill and a half-drawn net curtain. Outside: rows of grey Polish prefabricated apartment blocks with only a few lit windows, low heavy clouds. On the far horizon a faint orange glow lights the underside of the clouds. Underexposed, moody, realistic, shot on a full-frame camera at high ISO with natural grain, no people, no text."
C="Documentary news photograph of a small Polish town street flooded with brown muddy water up to the car windows. Old pastel tenement houses with wet facades, a half-submerged car, floating debris, grey overcast sky, steady rain, a rescue boat far in the background. Realistic, handheld news camera look, muted colours, natural grain, no text, no logos, no faces."
N="cgi, 3d render, illustration, painting, oversaturated, hdr, text, watermark, logo, people, faces"
for s in 11 22 33; do genimg "$A" -o A_ulica_$s.png --model flux --quality --size 1920x1088 --seed $s --negative "$N"; done
for s in 11 22 33; do genimg "$B" -o B_okno_$s.png --model flux --quality --size 1920x1088 --seed $s --negative "$N"; done
for s in 11 22; do genimg "$C" -o C_powodz_$s.png --model flux --quality --size 1920x1088 --seed $s --negative "$N"; done
